_ce006_1_06_s_5","text":"Their bodies have become overgrown with moss, making them look like a part of the natural landscape.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_6","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_6","text":"We cautiously head down to the ground floor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["neon","anis","privaty","rapi","roam","com"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_7","text":"Confirmation of death. No surprise there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_8","text":"And for a long time at that. I'm not even picking up any brain activity.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_9","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_10","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_11","text":"If I may.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_12","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_12","text":"Privaty steps forward and searches the bodies of the fallen Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_13","text":"There doesn't seem to be any data stored inside. Then again, even if there was, it would have almost certainly been damaged by the water and electricity.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_14","text":"They're wearing dog tags. Old models.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_15","text":"These might help us find out something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_16","text":"All right, take them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_17","text":"I'm going to head back to the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_18","text":"I'll take Roam and Com with me, and make sure they get to come back to the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_19","text":"All right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_20","text":"The Ark... I'm looking forward to it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"com","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_21","text":"------","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_22","text":"Oh, just a moment. I received a message from the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_23","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_23","text":"Privaty steps away.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["ce006_npc_01","ce006_03","ce006_01","elegg"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_24","text":"This door underneath them has welding marks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_25","text":"Considering which side they're on,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_26","text":"it must have been soldered from the outside.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_27","text":"I hope it wasn't done to keep people inside from getting out...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_28","text":"I hope so too...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_29","text":"How long will it take to open this up?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_30","text":"If we go full steam ahead, we should be able to pop it open quickly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_31","text":"If we're careful about it, I'd say maybe half a day?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_32","text":"How are the repairs on the Tetrapod going?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_33","text":"All done! We've even finished running all the necessary tests.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_34","text":"I may not have been able to do a deep dive into the schematics like I wanted, but it was still a fun project.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_35","text":"Repairing things is always a hoot.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_36","text":"Sorry to interrupt,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_37","text":"but I just got a report confirming the location of Gatekeeper.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_38","text":"It's approximately 20 kilometers from here, in the old downtown area.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_39","text":"Nice. Sounds like they're making progress.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_40","text":"So, if we deal with this Gatekeeper character, we might be able to return to our world?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_41","text":"That's right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_42","text":"That's good news.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_43","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_44","text":"But I don't think we'll be heading back any time soon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_45","text":"What? Why not?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_46","text":"Because a certain someone we know can never resist getting involved in other people's affairs.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_47","text":"Right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_48","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_heartdestroyer","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_49","text":"Adam, Lily. I'm sorry, but I would like to delay our return for a while.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_50","text":"I want to find out what's happening here and help in any way I can.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_51","text":"I'm also curious to find out what's behind that door.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_52","text":"I knew it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_53","text":"Hehe, yeah, we totally called it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_54","text":"Are you sure? Don't you need to hurry back?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_55","text":"You're not duty-bound to help us by any means.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_56","text":"You helped with the repair of the Tetrapod.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_57","text":"And besides, do you always need a reason to want to help someone?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_06_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_06_s_58","text":"Wow, I can't remember the last time I heard someone speak in such... l